\p
\v 11 \add One day\add* Yahweh's¦114445 messenger¦114444 came¦114443 and¦114443 sat¦114446 beneath the oak tree in \add the town of\add* Ofrah¦114450. (The¦114448 tree belonged¦114452 to the Abi¦114453-Ezrite¦114454, Yoash¦114452.) Yoah's son¦114456 Gideon¦114455 was¦114457 beating¦114457 wheat¦114458 \add down\add* in a wine-pressing¦114459 \add pit\add* to hide¦114460 it from¦114461 the Midianites
