\p
\v 13 “With¦114485 me¦114481, my¦114482 master¦114482?” Gideon¦114480 \add ≈asked\add*. “If Yahweh is¦114485 with¦114509 us, then¦114478 why's all of this¦114490 happened¦114487 to us? Where¦114491 are¦114492 all of the miracles¦114494 that¦114495 our¦114499 ancestors¦114499 told us about¦114488, saying¦114478, ‘Didn't Yahweh bring¦114503 us up¦114503 out of Egypt¦114502?’ But¦114478 now¦114505 Yahweh has¦114506 abandoned¦114506 us and¦114478 handed¦114508 us over to the Midianites.”
\p
\v 14 Then¦114513 Yahweh¦114515 turned¦114513 to him¦114514 and¦114513 said¦114516, “Use your¦114518 strength¦114518 to set Yisrael¦114523 free from¦114524 the¦114524 grasp of¦114524 Midian¦114525. Haven't I¦114527 sent¦114527 you¦114527 \add to do that\add*?”
