\v 15 “Please, my master¦114532,” Gideon replied¦114529, “how¦114533 could \em I\em* save Yisrael¦114537? Look, my clan is¦114540 the weakest¦114540 in Menashsheh¦114541 and¦114542 \add on top of that\add*, I'm¦114542 the youngest¦114543 in my \add ≈family¦114539\add*.”
