\p
\v 1 \add But\add* then¦115725 the Efrayimite men¦115727 \add ≈challenged\add* Gideon, “Why have¦115733 you \add ≈side-tracked\add* us? Why didn't¦115735 you call us when you went¦115739 to¦115740 battle against¦115741 the Midianites?” And¦115742 they¦115742 severely rebuked him¦115743.
\p
\v 2 “What \add ≈have¦115750 I¦115750 achieved compared¦115752 to you¦115752 guys\add*?” \add ≈answered¦115746\add* \add @Gideon\add*. “Aren't the \add ≈seconds\add* of Efrayim's¦115756 grapes¦115757 better than¦115757 the \add whole\add* grape¦115757 harvest¦115757 of Abiezer¦115758?
