\v 8 From¦115862 there they climbed up to Penuel¦115863, and he¦115864 \add ≈asked them¦115865 for food in a similar manner\add*, and the \add ≈leaders there\add* responded similarly to the \add ≈leaders\add* of¦115873 Sukkot¦115874.
