\v 10 \add ≈Now\add* Zebah¦115891 and Zalmunna¦115892 were in¦115893 Karkor¦115893 with¦115893 around fifteen thousand warriors—all that remained¦115900 out of all of that allied Midianite camp of eastern¦115905 people¦115903, because one¦115907 hundred¦115907 and twenty¦115908 thousand of their¦115894 warriors had already been killed.
