\v 12 Zebah¦115931 and Zalmunna¦115932 fled¦115930, but¦115930 \add #they¦115930\add* chased after¦115934 those two¦115938 Midianite kings¦115940 and captured¦115935 them¦115934, thus defeating their entire¦115948 army¦115950.
\p
\v 13 The Gideon¦115954 (Yoash's¦115957 son¦115955) \add and his warriors\add* returned¦115953 from battle¦115960, going through the Heres¦115962 pass.
