\v 21 Then¦116092 Zebah and Zalmunna said¦116092, “Come and kill us¦116099 yourself—\add ≈be a man¦116101 and use your own strength¦116102\add*.” So¦116092 Gideon¦116104 \add ≈went over\add* and killed¦116105 Zebah and Zalmunna, and then¦116092 he¦116112 took¦116112 the¦116115 crescent-shaped ornaments¦116115 that¦116116 were¦116117 on¦116099 their¦116118 camels' necks¦116117.
