\p
\v 28 \add ≈So¦116244\add* Midian¦116245 was \add ≈kept under control by the Israelis¦116248\add* and they¦116250 didn't¦116249 continue to¦116251 \add ≈oppress the people¦116247\add*, and there was peace¦116253 in¦116257 the region for forty¦116255 years¦116256 during Gideon's¦116258 time¦116257.
