\p
\v 1 \add ≈Now\add* after¦117475 Abimelek¦117476, Tola¦117481 (the son of Puah¦117484, the son of Dodo¦117487, \add ≈from the tribe\add* of Yissakar¦117489) \add ≈came on¦117493 the scene\add* to rescue¦117477 Yisrael¦117480. He¦117490 settled in Shamir¦117493, in the hill¦117494 country¦117494 of Efrayim¦117495.
\v 2 He \add ≈led\add* Yisrael¦117500 for twenty-three¦117501 years¦117503, then¦117497 he died¦117504 and¦117497 was¦117505 buried¦117505 in¦117506 Shamir¦117506.
\s1 Yair
