\v 3 So¦117843 Yiftah fled¦117843 from¦117845 the presence of his¦117846 \add half-\add*brothers and he¦117843 settled in¦117848 the Tob¦117849 region¦117848. Unprincipled men¦117854 associated around Yiftah and went¦117856 around with¦117857 him¦117857.
