\v 7 “Don't¦117904 you all hate¦117906 me? Yiftah¦117901 asked \add *them\add*. “Didn't¦117903 you yourselves drive¦117908 me out¦117908 of my father's¦117910 house¦117909? \add ≈So¦117900\add* why¦117911 have you all come¦117912 to¦117913 me now¦117914 when you have \add #troubles\add*?”
