\v 12 Then Yiftah¦118007 sent¦118006 messengers¦118008 to the \add ≈Ammonite\add* king¦118011, demanding, “What's¦118016 happened with¦118025 respect to me and¦118019 to you, that you've¦118022 come¦118022 against¦118025 me to fight¦118024 over my¦118025 land¦118025?”
