\v 25 Are¦118286 you really¦118285 better¦118285 now¦118284 than¦118288 Zippor's¦118291 son¦118289, King¦118292 Balak¦118288 of Moab¦118293? Did¦118295 he dare contend with¦118303 Yisrael¦118298 or¦118299 did¦118302 he ever wage¦118302 war¦118302 against¦118303 them?\x + \xo 11:25: \xt Num 22:1-6.\x*
\v 26 Yisrael¦118306 lived¦118305 in Heshbon¦118307 and in its villages for three¦118319 hundred¦118320 years¦118321, and in Aroer¦118309 and in its villages, and in all¦118311 the cities¦118313 that are along the banks of¦118317 the Arnon¦118318—\add ≈so\add* why¦118322 didn't¦118323 you repossess \add <them¦118325\add* during that time¦118326?
