\v 29 Then Yahweh's¦118370 spirit¦118369 \add ≈empowered\add* Yiftah¦118368, and he passed through the Gilead and Menashsheh¦118377, and through Mizpah¦118381 of¦118382 Gilead, and from¦118383 \add *there\add* he passed through the \add ≈Ammonite region\add*,
