\v 34 \add ≈When¦118466\add* Yiftah¦118461 got back to his house¦118465 in¦118470 the Mizpah¦118462 area, look, his daughter was coming¦118468 out¦118468 to meet¦118469 him¦118469 with tambourines¦118470 and¦118471 with dancing¦118471. She¦118473 was \add &their\add* only¦118474 child¦118474—he didn't¦118475 have any son¦118479 or¦118480 daughter apart from her.
