\v 7 Yiftah¦118780 the Gileadite¦118781 \add ≈led\add* Yisrael¦118776 for six¦118777 years¦118778, then¦118772 \add *he¦118782\add* died¦118779 and¦118772 was¦118782 buried¦118782 among the cities¦118783 of¦118783 Gilead¦118784.
