\p
\v 1 The¦118902 \add ≈Israelis¦118896\add* continued to do¦118897 \add ≈what Yahweh¦118900 considered as evil¦118898\add*, so \add *he\add* \add ≈allowed the Philistines¦118905 to oppress them\add* for forty¦118906 years¦118907.
\v 2 \add ≈Now\add* there was a man¦118911 named Manoah¦118917 from Zorah¦118913, of the families of the Danites¦118915. His wife¦118918 was barren¦118919 \add ≈so they had¦118921 no children¦118921\add*.
