\v 5 because you'll¦118960 definitely become pregnant¦118961 and will \add ≈give birth to\add* a son¦118963. \add ≈His¦118970 hair must¦118961 never be cut\add* because \add *he'll¦118975\add* be a Nazirite¦118973 to God¦118974 from \add ≈his conception\add*. He¦118960 will begin¦118981 to rescue¦118982 Yisrael¦118985 from the \add ≈oppression\add* of¦118986 the Philistines¦118987.”\x + \xo 13:5: \xt Num 6:1-5.\x*
