\p “I'm a Levite¦120993 from Bethlehem in¦121001 Yehudah¦120997,” he¦120991 \add ≈replied¦120985\add*, “and¦120985 I'm \add ≈trying to find¦121002 a good place to stay¦121000 a while\add*.”
\p
\v 10 “Stay¦121014 with¦121008 me,” said¦121004 Micah¦121006, “and be like a father¦121012 and a priest¦121013 to me. I'll¦121015 give¦121015 you ten¦121018 silver¦121019 coins a year¦121020 as well as \add ≈board and clothing\add*.” So¦121004 the¦121025 Levite¦121025 \add man\add* went¦121024 in
