\p
\v 19 “Stay quiet¦121475,” they¦121473 told him¦121474. “Put¦121476 your hand¦121478 over¦121479 your mouth¦121481 and come¦121482 with¦121501 us, and be like a father¦121487 and a priest for us. Is¦121491 it better¦121489 to be a priest for \add only\add* \add ≈one¦121495 household¦121493\add*, or¦121496 to be a priest for a \add whole\add* related tribe¦121499 in¦121501 Yisrael¦121501?”
\v 20 The¦121504 priest¦121505 \add ≈liked that idea\add*, so he¦121506 went¦121516 along with¦121517 them—taking¦121506 the \add ≈priestly¦121505 gear\add* and the \add ≈household idols\add*, and the carved¦121515 image¦121515.
\p
\v 21 Then¦121520 they \add went back to the main path\add* and continued on their¦121532 way with the children, animals, and \add those carrying\add* the valuable¦121531 property going in front¦121532.
\v 22 When they'd already gone¦121535 \add ≈quite some\add* distance from¦121536 Micah's¦121537 house¦121540, Micah and \add ≈his neighbours\add* gathered together¦121546, then the men¦121538 ran \add in a group\add* and caught up with¦121540 the \add ≈Danites\add*.
\v 23 They¦121554 called¦121568 \add ≈out¦121554 to the Danites\add* who turned¦121560 around \add ≈to face¦121561 them\add* and¦121554 \add ≈asked\add* Micah¦121563, “What's¦121564 \add ≈the matter? Why has¦121568 this group come\add* together¦121568?”
\v 24 “You all took¦121577 my¦121573 gods¦121573 that¦121574 I made¦121576,” Micah \add ≈replied¦121570\add*, “And¦121578 the priest¦121580. Then¦121570 you \add ≈disappeared and¦121570 I had nothing left\add*. \add ≈So¦121570\add* how can you all \add ≈ask\add* me what¦121591 \add ≈the matter is¦121593\add*!”
\p
\v 25 “\add ≈I wouldn't say¦121595 too much if I was you,” he was told. “Otherwise some of our more fiery men¦121609 might start to get a bit hostile, then¦121595 you'd bring about¦121597 your own death, and¦121595 that of your companions\add*!”
\v 26 Then¦121617 Micah¦121623 realised¦121622 that they were¦121626 too¦121626 strong¦121626 for \add #them\add*, so \add #they\add* turned¦121629 back around and¦121617 went¦121617 home¦121633.
