\p \add ≈So¦121617\add* the¦121618 Danites¦121620 continued onward,
\v 27 taking¦121636 with them the things that¦121638 Micah¦121641 had¦121640 made¦121640, as well as his priest¦121644. They¦121649 came¦121649 to¦121650 Layish¦121652 where the unsuspecting¦121657 people¦121655 were living peaceably¦121656, and they¦121658 slaughtered them with their swords¦121662 and burnt¦121666 down the city¦121665.
